  - sentenceType: 0
    speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 2e240942c73318642b0f986813494e10, type: 2}
    text: Archer. You hurt me. A lot. But you also made me laugh from the first day,
      in the garden, at the plaza. I cannot pretend those moments meant nothing.
    actions:
    - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 2e240942c73318642b0f986813494e10, type: 2}
      spriteIndex: 12
      actionType: 0
      coords: {x: -450, y: 0}
